# What the image build context leaves out (P1.27): history, local installs and builds (each stage installs and
# builds its own), tests, docs and secrets. The runtime stage copies named folders only; this keeps the rest out of
# the build stages too.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
.worktrees
# interfaces/web's local builds (each image builds its own) and its test-only routes (P1.20j): those are served only
# under the test profile, and leaving them out here keeps them out of the bundle and the route table server.ts reads.
interfaces/web/build
interfaces/web/.svelte-kit
interfaces/web/src/routes/test-routes
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
tests
docs
.env
.env.*
secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
# P2.26m: the deploy lock and the dev stack file name published digests; no image is built from them, and a lock bump
# must not count as an image input (publish-images.yml ignores a push that changes only these).
deployment/images.lock.json
deployment/compose.dev.yaml
